                                "sense_id": "7fa6e414-4cd5-3c31-b3a8-0411d275f809",
                                "text": "[…] Self-appointed 'reformers' of heraldic terminology will contend that since lions morné and lions eviré have have barely an existence in current armory, the words themselves are mere textbook fill-up […]"
